<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Craft a genome excavator to extract genomes from tamed or dead animals. This excavator can extract Dinosauria and Biomes! Prehistoric genomes.-->
  <GR_CraftDinoGenomeExcavator.description>制作基因组提取器，从驯服或死亡的动物中提取基因组。这台提取器可以提取恐龙和生物群系！史前基因组。</GR_CraftDinoGenomeExcavator.description>
  <!--EN: Craft Dino Genome excavator-->
  <GR_CraftDinoGenomeExcavator.label>工艺恐龙基因组提取器</GR_CraftDinoGenomeExcavator.label>
  <!--EN: Make a batch of compressed chemfuel by extracting it from a parasaurolope corpse.-->
  <GR_ParasaurolopeCorpseToCompressedChemfuel.description>从副蜥蜴尸体中提取来制造一批压缩化学燃料。</GR_ParasaurolopeCorpseToCompressedChemfuel.description>
  <!--EN: Refining compressed chemfuel from a parasaurolope corpse.-->
  <GR_ParasaurolopeCorpseToCompressedChemfuel.jobString>从副蜥蜴尸体中提炼压缩化学燃料。</GR_ParasaurolopeCorpseToCompressedChemfuel.jobString>
  <!--EN: make compressed chemfuel from a parasaurolope corpse-->
  <GR_ParasaurolopeCorpseToCompressedChemfuel.label>用副蜥蜴尸体制作压缩化学燃料</GR_ParasaurolopeCorpseToCompressedChemfuel.label>
